<section class="chapter-milestones" aria-labelledby="lapis-milestones-title"><div><p class="eyebrow">January · Learning together</p><h3 id="lapis-milestones-title">How Project LAPIS began</h3><p>LAPIS means Learning Assistance Program and Inclusive Support. JCI Carmona joined local groups in this city program for children and young people who need learning support.</p></div><ol><li><time datetime="2026-01-24">24 January 2026</time><strong>Community introduction</strong><p>The city and its partners introduced the program at Carmona Plaza.</p></li><li><time datetime="2026-01-31">31 January 2026</time><strong>Pilot launch in Milagrosa</strong><p>The program launched at its pilot site in Barangay Milagrosa.</p></li></ol><a class="text-link" href="https://mb.com.ph/2026/02/02/carmona-lgu-rolls-out-literacy-project-for-out-of-school-children-youth" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Read the Manila Bulletin report ↗</a></section>
